## SSL Configuration

## Each certificate has it's own item. The key is the cert name. Each cert
## needs a domain list and an admin email. Each cert name also needs a
## corresponding entry in 'dns.yml' for the DNS update.
certificates:
  my.domain.com:
    admin_email: myemail@example.com
    domains:
      - my.domain.com
      - "*.my.domain.com"


## The following is the crontab setup for the automatic renewal script.
certificates_renewal:
  minute: "0"
  hour: "0"
  day: "1,15"
  month: "*"
  weekday: "*"
